    "same_weights": "The upstream arm serves the pinned v2 artifact upgraded offline with upstream's tools/upgrade_ninfer_v2_to_v3.py, which copies every weight byte and appends the maintained chat template; only the container and template differ.",
    "same_serving_arguments": "Both arms run the shipped profile qwen38-5090-v0.7.0 settings: 131,072 context, bf16 KV, MTP draft 3, 16384 MiB host KV, 4 device-state and 24 host-state slots, 8 private continuations. Upstream rejects the fork-only identity and checkpoint flags, so its arm omits them.",
    "wire": "The shipped arm receives the authenticated session header and body field; the upstream arm receives neither, because upstream rejects unknown body fields.",
